! I-Box 1 diagnostic program, octal 5247.00 through 5461.40 -- TWELVE
! consecutive test groups from docs/ja_ax1a_ibox-1.pdf pp.46-51,
! transcribed VERBATIM as one contiguous span at the listing's own
! addresses, with the deck's own pass/fail mechanism intact throughout:
!
!   CBR         IBR96..IBR101   5247.00  (p.46 bottom / p.47 top)
!   CBR+        IBR102..IBR108  5261.00  "count, branch refill, + add one to value"
!   CBR-        IBR109..IBR115  5276.00  "... sub one from value"
!   CBRH        IBR116..IBR122  5312.00  "... add half to value"
!   CBRZ        IBR123..IBR140  5326.00  "count, branch on zero, + refill"
!   CBRZ+       IBR141..IBR158  5343.00
!   CBRZ-       IBR159..IBR176  5360.00
!   CBRZH       IBR177..IBR194  5375.00
!   SIC-CB      ISCB..ISCBH     5412.00  (these five were first run as their
!   SIC-CBZ     ISCB5..ISCBK    5421.00   own span, ibox1_p50_p51_span.strap,
!                                         now superseded by this file)
!   SIC-B,ZIND  ISBI..ISBXW     5432.40
!   SIC-B,IND   ISBI5..ISBIK    5443.00
!   (indicators) WEN2/WEN/VEN   5454.00  (WEN6/WEN7 at 6102/6103)
!
! Control flow, as the deck wrote it. In the count-and-branch groups
! every "B,$" or "BD,$" is a hang, and the group proves itself by
! storing X1's whole index word over one of them with SX ("SX TO TEST
! VALUE" / "SX FOR VALUE TEST"): the XW literal it started from puts a
! bit-address like IBR106+(8).04 in the value field, chosen so that the
! value the variant SHOULD have produced (two CBR+ = +2.0 words, five
! CBRZH = +2.40, two CBR- = -2.0 ...) reads as "BD,<the next hang>"
! when executed as an instruction -- so a correct value branches on,
! a wrong one lands on a hang. The count-to-zero call then refills X1
! from a second XW whose value reads as "BD,<the group's NOP-valued VF
! pair>", stored the same way ("SX + TEST FOR REFILL"), and the chain
! walks: value-test hang -> refill-test hang -> VF NOPs -> next group.
! The SIC groups are described in ibox1_sic_cb_cbz.strap's header; the
! SIC-B groups' own detail is in verify_ibox1_listing.py's ROWS_SICB
! comment. The whole span ends where
! VEN's own "BRGZZ,$+1.0" lands, 5462.00, the start of the (floating-
! point, out of scope) "Y-Z CONTROL SEQUENCES" test -- the ONE
! substituted instruction here is a BEW,$ at that address.
!
! What the count-and-branch groups pin down that no earlier test
! could: the H / + / - value increments of the CB family. Reference
! Manual p.41's table says H adds "one in bit position 18" of the
! value field and +/- add or subtract "one in bit position 17" -- i.e.
! a half-word (32 bits) and a word (64 bits) of bit address -- and the
! listing's own arithmetic agrees (IBRA23's value 5405.44 plus five
! halves is 5410.04, exactly IBR193+.04, where its comment says the
! value test must land). bsv/README.md had recorded the model's
! mapping (+1/+2/-2 raw bit units) as an unconfirmed best-effort
! reading; it was wrong by a factor of 32, and this span is the test
! that would have hung at IBR106 under it.
!
! Expected final state (ibox1_expected.py): halt PC 5462.00; every
! SX-stored word (value-test words as X1's full index word at that
! point, refill-test words as copies of the refill XW); every SIC- or
! SV-rewritten hang of the p.50-51 groups.
!
! Listing text restored from the printout's %..= to (..). Two scan
! readings are noted in verify_ibox1_listing.py (BZXVLZ,ISBI5 and
! IBR184's CBRZH). The "66"/"6"/"666" marks in the listing's right
! margin are ignored.
!
! Bug injections, observed results:
!   C. LX without index-indicator setting (StretchExecute.bsv DirIndex
!      arm): 6 of 13 fail on the pp.50-51 half alone -- PC parks at
!      ISBIC, the hang after BZXCZ (the preceding SV had left XCZ on).
!   D. CB half/one units back to 1/2/-2 raw bits: 26 of 28 fail -- PC
!      parks at IBR106 (the first incrementing variant's value test),
!      only CBR's two v=00 words (IBR100, IBR107) still pass. Exactly
!      as predicted.
! Both reverted by targeted un-patch; full suite green.

        SLC, (8)5247.0
IBR96   LX,$X1,IBRA9         ! -SET UP XW
IBR97   CBR,$X1,IBR98        ! -COUNT 3 TO 2,BR,NO REFILL
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
IBR98   CBR,$X1,IBR99        ! -COUNT 2 TO 1,BR,NO REFILL
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -WRONG BRANCH
IBR99   CBR,$X1,HANGS1       ! -COUNT 1 TO 0,NO BR, REFILL
        SX,$X1,IBR100        ! -STORE NEW XW
        B,IBR100
        NOP,0.0              ! -BRANCH TO NEW INST.
IBRA9   XW,IBRA9+(8).04,3,IBRA10        ! -ORIGIANL XW
IBRA10  XW,IBR101+(8).04,(8)37777,-1    ! -REFILL XW
IBR100  B,$                  ! -BECOMES BD,IBR101
        B,$                  ! -ALL 1
HANGS1  B,$                  ! -WRONG BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -WRONG BRANCH
IBR101  VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
        VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
IBR102  LX,$X1,IBRA11        ! -SET UP XW
IBR103  CBR+,$X1,IBR104      ! -COUNT 3 TO 2,1 TO VAL,+ BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
IBR104  CBR+,$X1,IBR105      ! -COUNT 2 TO 1,1 TO VAL,+BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -WRONG BRANCH
IBR105  SX,$X1,IBR106        ! -SX TO TEST VALUE
        CBR+,$X1,HANGS2      ! -COUNT 1TO0,NOV+,NOB,REFILL
        SX,$X1,IBR107        ! -SX + TEST FOR REFILL
        B,IBR106             ! -BRANCH TO VALUE TEST
        NOP,0.0
IBRA11  XW,IBR106+(8).04,3,IBRA12       ! -ORIGINAL XW
IBRA12  XW,IBR108+(8).04,(8)37777,-1
IBR106  B,$                  ! -HANG,OR BRANCH TO REFILL TEST
        B,$
HANGS2  B,$                  ! -BRANCHED AT COUNT 0,ERROR
        B,$
IBR107  B,$                  ! -REFILL TEST HANG OR BRANCH OUT
        B,$                  ! -ALL 1
        B,$
        B,$
IBR108  VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
        VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
IBR109  LX,$X1,IBRA13        ! -SET UP XW
IBR110  CBR-,$X1,IBR111      ! -COUNT 3TO 2, VAL.-1, +BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
IBR111  CBR-,$X1,IBR112      ! -COUNT 2TO 1,VAL.-1,+BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -WRONG BRANCH
IBR112  SX,$X1,IBR113        ! -SX TO TEST VALUE
        CBR-,$X1,HANGS3      ! -COUNT 1TO 0, NOV-, NO B,REFILL
        SX,$X1,IBR114        ! -SX +TEST FOR REFILL
        B,IBR113             ! -BRANCH TO VALUE TEST
IBRA13  XW,IBR115+(8).04,3,IBRA14       ! -ORIGINAL XW
IBRA14  XW,IBR115+(8).04,(8)37777,-1    ! -REFILL XW
IBR113  B,$                  ! -HANG OR BRANCH TO REFILL TEST
        B,$
HANGS3  B,$                  ! -BRANCHED AT COUNT 0,ERROR
        B,$
IBR114  B,$                  ! -REFILL TEST HANG OR BRANCH OUT
        B,$                  ! -ALL 1
        B,$
        B,$
IBR115  VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
        VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
IBR116  LX,$X1,IBRA15        ! -SET UP XW
IBR117  CBRH,$X1,IBR118      ! -COUNT 3TO2,VAL+.4,+BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
IBR118  CBRH,$X1,IBR119      ! -COUNT 2TO1,VAL+.4,+BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -NO BRANCH
        B,$                  ! -WRONG BRANCH
IBR119  SX,$X1,IBR120        ! -SX TO TEST VALUE
        CBRH,$X1,HANGS4      ! -COUNT 1TO0,NO V+,NOB,REFILL
        SX,$X1,IBR121        ! -SX + TEST FOR REFILL
        B,IBR120             ! -BRANCH TO VALUE TEST
IBRA15  XW,HANGS4+(8).04,3,IBRA16       ! -ORIGINAL XW
IBRA16  XW,IBR122+(8).04,(8)37777,-1    ! -REFILL XW
IBR120  B,$                  ! -HANG OR BRANCH TO REFILL TEST
        B,$
HANGS4  B,$                  ! -BRANCH AT COUNT 0,ERROR
        B,$
IBR121  B,$                  ! -REFILL TEST,HANG OR BRANCH OUT
        B,$                  ! -ALL 1
        B,$
        B,$
IBR122  VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
        VF,(8)777777.70      ! -NOP,-.32
IBR123  LX,$X1,IBRA17        ! -SET UP XW
IBR124  CBRZ,$X1,IBR132      ! -COUNT 6 TO 5, NO B OR REF.
IBR125  CBRZ,$X1,IBR133      ! -COUNT 5 TO 4, NO B OR REF.
IBR126  CBRZ,$X1,IBR134      ! -COUNT 4 TO 3, NO B OR REF.
IBR127  CBRZ,$X1,IBR135      ! -COUNT 3 TO 2, NO B OR REF.
IBR128  CBRZ,$X1,IBR136      ! -COUNT 2 TO 1 NO B OR REF.
IBR129  SX,$X1,IBR138        ! -SX FOR VALUE TEST
IBR130  CBRZ,$X1,IBR137      ! -SHOULD BRANCH + REFILL C TO 0
IBR131  B,$                  ! -HANG UP IF NO B ON ZERO
IBR132  B,$                  ! -HANG UP IF B ON NOT ZERO
IBR133  B,$                  ! -HANG UP IF B ON NOT ZER
IBR134  B,$                  ! -HANG UP IF B ON NOT ZER
IBR135  B,$                  ! -HANG UP IF B ON NOT ZER
IBR136  B,$                  ! -HANG UP IF B ON NOT ZERO
IBR137  SX,$X1,IBR139        ! -HANG UP IF B ON NOT ZERO
        B,IBR138             ! -GO TO VALUE TEST
IBRA17  XW,IBR139+(8).04,6,IBRA18       ! -COMMON XW
IBRA18  XW,IBR140+(8).04,(8)37777,-1    ! -REFILL XW
IBR138  B,$                  ! -IF HANG UP, VALUE ON CBRZ WRONG
        B,$
IBR139  B,$                  ! -IF HANG UP, FAULTY REFILL ZERO
        B,$                  ! -ALL 1 S
IBR140  VF,(8)777777.70      ! -EQUALS NOP,-.32
        VF,(8)777777.70      ! -EQUALS NOP,-.32
IBR141  LX,$X1,IBRA19        ! -SET UP XW
IBR142  CBRZ+,$X1,IBR150     ! -COUNT 6 TO 5, NO B OR REF.
